{"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link","title":"Presenting from a link","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"generated":true}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Presenting from a link","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"code":"openid4vp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". It fetches the Verifier’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","isActive":true},{"text":" before anything is shown.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it returns says:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"who is asking: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", its name, and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when a registrar the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet trusts ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") registered it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each with the held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials that can answer it, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Present","anchor":"Present"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation: Presentation","    do {","        presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    } catch let error as WalletError where error.code == .requestRefused {","        \/\/ A refused request: the Verifier was told, and may say where to","        \/\/ take the holder next (OpenID4VP §8.2).","        return wallet.takeRefusalRedirect()","    }","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection: Presentation.Selection","    let disclosures: [Presentation.Disclosure]","    do {","        selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","        disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    } catch {","        \/\/ Nothing can be shown: decline, so the Verifier isn't left waiting.","        _ = try? await presentation.decline()","        throw error","    }","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()","type":"reference"},{"text":" picks the first credential that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection","type":"reference"},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each query’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","type":"reference"},{"text":" instead: a query that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selection, after checking it answers the request","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection"},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)"},{"type":"text","text":" says what it would disclose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"agrees."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", when the Verifier sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page. The library refuses http and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schemes that run code or read local data, but lets through a scheme the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier’s own app may have registered: open an https URL in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"browser, any other only through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication.open"},{"text":", never in a web","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view, and never one in the wallet’s own schemes ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":", its redirect URI’s), which would start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another flow in the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"When the wallet refuses a request","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"When-the-wallet-refuses-a-request"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A request the wallet must not answer — one with ","type":"text"},{"code":"transaction_data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t support, or a parameter OpenID4VP forbids — makes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true},{"text":" throw","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/requestRefused","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/protocolError","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the error code the wallet sent the Verifier, such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_transaction_data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Nothing is shown to the holder, and nothing","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is presented. The Verifier may answer the refusal with a redirect:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/takeRefusalRedirect()","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns it, once, and you open it in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the browser the request came from, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so the holder isn’t left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stranded. Tell the holder the request wasn’t answered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the claims it asks for beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it’s registered to request, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregisteredAll","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it names no claims at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all. The library flags such a query in full, though OpenID4VP 1.0"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"§6.4.1 reads it as asking for no selectively disclosable claims, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation for it discloses only what the credential always shows."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is refused for them: show them, and let the holder decide."}]},{"text":"Keep presentations unlinkable","anchor":"Keep-presentations-unlinkable","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each presentation uses a copy of the credential, bound to its own key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so two Verifiers can’t link the holder’s presentations by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/copyPolicy-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" chooses which copy:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perPresentation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the default: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copy no Verifier has seen, every time.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": the copy a Verifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has seen before, so it can recognize a returning holder, and an unused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one for a new Verifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once every copy is used, one is reused. A candidate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether presenting it now would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand this Verifier a copy another has seen: warn the holder, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh the credential ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") when its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" reaches zero.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"When delivery is uncertain","level":3,"anchor":"When-delivery-is-uncertain"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If sending the response fails in a way that leaves it unknown whether","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifier received it, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/respond(selection:)","isActive":true},{"text":" throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/deliveryUnknown","isActive":true},{"text":" and doesn’t send it again: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder should check with the Verifier before sharing again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Query/credentials":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The held credentials that can answer it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/query\/credentials","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"credentials"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","text":"CredentialSummary"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"type":"topic","title":"credentials"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/CopyPolicy-swift.enum/perVerifier":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/copypolicy-swift.enum\/perverifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"perVerifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/CopyPolicy-swift.enum\/perVerifier","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier is shown the copy it has seen before, and only a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifier an unused one: Verifiers can’t link presentations to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each other, but one can recognise a returning holder."}],"type":"topic","title":"WalletConfiguration.CopyPolicy.perVerifier"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Query/unregistered":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"unregistered"},{"kind":"text","text":": [["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PathElement","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet12PresentationC11PathElementO"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}],"type":"topic","title":"unregistered","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration: the claims paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this query asks for beyond it, then those its credentials would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disclose along with them beyond it (the rest of an array","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disclosed as one, say). Nothing is refused for them: the holder decides.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/unregistered","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/query\/unregistered"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Presentation/Registration":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Registration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A Verifier’s registration with a registrar: who it is and what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"may request, as the registrar attests.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Registration","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentation\/registration","title":"Presentation.Registration"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/untrustedVerifier":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/untrustedverifier","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"untrustedVerifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwalle